<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<th class="mobile-padding small-12 large-12 columns first last" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 20px; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">
<table style="padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">
<h1 style="margin: 0px 0px 17.39px;padding-top: 25px;text-align: left;color: #fefefe;line-height: 1.3;font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 400;border-collapse: collapse !important;-ms-word-break: keep-all;-ms-word-wrap: normal;-ms-hyphens: none;-moz-hyphens: none;-webkit-hyphens: none;hyphens: none;">인텔&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스 프로그램을 신청해 주셔서&nbsp;감사합니다.</h1>
</th>
<th class="callout-inner" style="padding:25px 15px;"><img src="https://intel--crmdevipa--c.cs45.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0158A00000028LJ&oid=00D8A0000005uU8&lastMod=1600939268000" alt="인텔" title="인텔" align="right" class="float-center" style="height:100%;width:auto"></th>
<th class="expander" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px !important; width: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; visibility: hidden;"></th>
